sequenceDiagram
    actor Retailer as "Retailer"
    participant UI as "Interface: UI"
    participant API as "mainController: Controller"
    participant Ship as "shipmentService: Service"
    participant DB as "PostgreSQL: Database"
    Retailer->>UI: Scan every dispatched QR label
    UI->>+API: POST /api/v1/shipments/{id}/receipt
    API->>Ship: ConfirmReceipt(actor, QR, quantity, idempotency)
    Ship->>DB: Verify retailer ownership, shipment, tag and quantity
    alt Valid and not already confirmed
        Ship->>DB: Save receipt confirmation and mark shipment received
        Ship->>DB: Check whether all order shipments are received
        alt All shipments received
            Ship->>DB: Set order Delivered/complete receipt
            Ship->>DB: Calculate deferred due date if applicable
        end
        API-->>-UI: Receipt confirmed
    else Invalid or duplicate QR
        API-->>UI: Conflict/error
    end
    Note over Ship,DB: Receipt does not create retailer inventory or automatically settle payment.


